  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "學習台文真正是teh走揣家己ê喙舌"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>朱淑君</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一斗上課練習造句寫著「藍色」，我自然tik就講出「青色」，了後又koh想講青色kám m̄是「綠色」？然後我就kā寫「藍色」，老師有講著「水色」，我tsiah知影lóng bē記--得--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh再有一斗講著『刷牙』、『刷卡』，同學講「抿喙齒」，我tsiah想起我細漢ê時ē講「齒抿仔」，tsit-má我suah bē記得「抿喙齒」tsit个詞。老師講因為『刷』ê動作台語有無仝講法。Tńg來厝--裡，lio̍h仔消化--leh tsiah想起細漢bat án-ne講，suah感覺淡薄仔悲傷。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我因為khah hân-bān，拄開始lóng bē-hiáu聲調、字母，連輸入法mā是烏白tshi̍h，tshi̍h ē出--來就準拄好，網頁mā真生份，只好khah骨力寫作業，沓沓仔來學習，tsiah ē-tàng lio̍h-lio̍h仔進步，iáu-m̄-koh mā是錯誤一大堆，實在是tsiok飯桶--ê。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">到尾站上課ê時tsūn開始出現漢字，he根本是另外一个世界，hit-tsūn我上tsia̍p講ê話母就是：「Ha̋nn，原來ài án-ne寫！」、「Ha̋nn，tse是啥mih字？！」、「Ha̋nn，原來我ê台語lóng講m̄-tio̍h。」、「感覺家己無知又koh趣味。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">多謝老師耐心牽教，忍受學生宿題烏白亂寫，多謝超人助教即時救援踮線頂浮沉、茫茫渺渺ê我，mā ài多謝友善ê同學做伙陪我重建自信，kā斷--去ê喙舌接--tńg-來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">最後ǹg望台灣tsiânn做真正ê台灣。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是「Ē-liàn-tńg台文讀寫基礎班」結業學員）</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi80t8PqPAwA9RxnAnwybAIr682kUFDFqdPX8GWmQC7hCu_kzZqQoXsOgDd_RnkM8b_Y7Z9whhoPW7ucv0vFvZ9e6lO2Hxl07CUKNal5D3zuhBDTLQYx_7I31m5MB182A5Eqz0WfwGJWKcaJgskWsy5XhW5zUwSxk_qC8Z7pX9JIKOtfJuMcj_yqN76cp7X/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_15.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi80t8PqPAwA9RxnAnwybAIr682kUFDFqdPX8GWmQC7hCu_kzZqQoXsOgDd_RnkM8b_Y7Z9whhoPW7ucv0vFvZ9e6lO2Hxl07CUKNal5D3zuhBDTLQYx_7I31m5MB182A5Eqz0WfwGJWKcaJgskWsy5XhW5zUwSxk_qC8Z7pX9JIKOtfJuMcj_yqN76cp7X/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_15.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkBNhYH5yQNtnFWOqTu7UKdBfeD6P3Ku5fSn1uuCskLFe9M4Fiz1IvyZhFyxUVyv5XjqMPePruWPNPtg6UfiatLhX3-_DFG5rSx4AFXZmFbtwFfeXpAAr9FBYY6GPTVZQXaQ-6qlsgQ7XirtrAKVEKEBOY16IVyYDhCMsFS9QhyphenhyphenJ-yEUui6lbW2utSHBZ_/s1424/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkBNhYH5yQNtnFWOqTu7UKdBfeD6P3Ku5fSn1uuCskLFe9M4Fiz1IvyZhFyxUVyv5XjqMPePruWPNPtg6UfiatLhX3-_DFG5rSx4AFXZmFbtwFfeXpAAr9FBYY6GPTVZQXaQ-6qlsgQ7XirtrAKVEKEBOY16IVyYDhCMsFS9QhyphenhyphenJ-yEUui6lbW2utSHBZ_/w450-h640/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div>